"vulcanism":{definition:"noun: an older or less common spelling of volcanism: volcanic activity and the geological processes associated with volcanoes.",synonyms:["volcanism","volcanicity"],example:{word:"vulcanism",text:"Older geological texts use vulcanism for the processes now usually called volcanism."},exampleSynonym:{word:"volcanism",text:"Modern geological texts use volcanism for processes associated with volcanoes."},translation:{es:"vulcanismo; variante antigua o menos común de volcanismo"}},
