"academy":{definition:"noun: an institution for advanced or specialized learning; a school or college, especially one that is private or focused on a particular subject. Also, a society of scholars or artists.",synonyms:["school","college","institute","learned society"],example:{word:"academy",text:"She studied music at a conservatory and later joined a literary academy."},exampleSynonym:{word:"institute",text:"She studied music at a conservatory and later joined a literary institute."},translation:{es:"academia; institución educativa; escuela especializada; sociedad de estudiosos"}},
